# f.apply(this, arguments): where no more arguments were passed than there are parameters, the call takes them by name; a tail call stays one on every arm
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass ResolveBuiltins
# CHECK: outcome: Changed

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"

function f0 name="oneParameter" flags=[HasThis, HasArgumentCount, HasHiddenRest] captures=[{type=function}] thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: function, v1: anything, v2: int[0, 4294967295], v3: anything, v4: Array):
    v5 = CreateUnmappedArguments v2, v4, v3
    v6 = Builtin builtin=FunctionPrototypeApply
    v7 = Call v6, v0, v1, v5 calleeKey="apply" calleeName="f.apply"
    ReturnCall v7
# CHECK: Switch v2 cases=[0, 1] -> case [[none0]](), case [[one0]](), otherwise [[more0]]()
# CHECK: [[none0]]():
# CHECK-NEXT: [[callNone0]]: anything = Call v0, v1
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall [[callNone0]]
# CHECK: [[one0]]():
# CHECK-NEXT: [[callOne0]]: anything = Call v0, v1, v3
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall [[callOne0]]
# CHECK: [[more0]]() frequency=Unlikely:
# CHECK-NEXT: = IsPristine v4 builtinClass=Array aspects=[Storage, Names]
# CHECK: [[parameters0]]: Array = NewArray v3 contents=anything
# CHECK-NEXT: AppendElements [[parameters0]], v4,
# CHECK-NEXT: [[callListed0]]: anything = CallList v0, v1, [[parameters0]]
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall [[callListed0]]
# CHECK: frequency=Rare:
# CHECK-NEXT: [[list0]]: {{*}} = NewArgumentList v0, v5
# CHECK-NEXT: [[callMore0]]: anything = CallList v0, v1, [[list0]]
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall [[callMore0]]
}

function f1 name="readsDoNotChangeTheObject" flags=[HasThis, HasArgumentCount, HasHiddenRest] captures=[{type=function}] thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}, {type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: function, v1: anything, v2: int[0, 4294967295], v3: anything, v4: anything, v5: Array):
    v6 = CreateUnmappedArguments v2, v5, v3, v4
    v7 = PropGet v6 key="length"
    v8 = Integer integer=5
    v9 = ElemGet v6, v8
    v10 = Builtin builtin=FunctionPrototypeApply
    v11 = Call v10, v0, v1, v6 calleeKey="apply" calleeName="f.apply"
    ReturnCall v11
# CHECK: Switch v2 cases=[0, 1, 2] -> case [[none1]](), case [[one1]](), case [[two1]](), otherwise [[more1]]()
# CHECK: [[two1]]():
# CHECK-NEXT: [[callTwo1]]: anything = Call v0, v1, v3, v4
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall [[callTwo1]]
}

# A store may have replaced an argument.
function f2 name="elementIsStored" flags=[HasThis, HasArgumentCount, HasHiddenRest] captures=[{type=function}] thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: function, v1: anything, v2: int[0, 4294967295], v3: anything, v4: Array):
    v5 = CreateUnmappedArguments v2, v4, v3
    v6 = Integer integer=0
    ElemSet v5, v6, v1
    v8 = Builtin builtin=FunctionPrototypeApply
    v9 = Call v8, v0, v1, v5 calleeKey="apply" calleeName="f.apply"
    ReturnCall v9
# CHECK-NOT: Switch
# CHECK: [[list2]]: {{*}} = NewArgumentList v0, v5
# CHECK-NEXT: v9: anything = CallList v0, v1, [[list2]]
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall v9
}

# Whoever gets the object may change it.
function f3 name="objectIsPassed" flags=[HasThis, HasArgumentCount, HasHiddenRest] captures=[{type=function}] thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: function, v1: anything, v2: int[0, 4294967295], v3: anything, v4: Array):
    v5 = CreateUnmappedArguments v2, v4, v3
    v6 = Call v0, v1, v5
    v7 = Builtin builtin=FunctionPrototypeApply
    v8 = Call v7, v0, v1, v5 calleeKey="apply" calleeName="f.apply"
    ReturnCall v8
# CHECK-NOT: Switch
# CHECK: [[list3]]: {{*}} = NewArgumentList v0, v5
# CHECK-NEXT: v8: anything = CallList v0, v1, [[list3]]
# CHECK-NEXT: ReturnCall v8
}

# The callee sees the object itself as its receiver.
function f4 name="objectIsAlsoTheReceiver" flags=[HasThis, HasArgumentCount, HasHiddenRest] captures=[{type=function}] thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: function, v1: anything, v2: int[0, 4294967295], v3: anything, v4: Array):
    v5 = CreateUnmappedArguments v2, v4, v3
    v6 = Builtin builtin=FunctionPrototypeApply
